# Aetheris-MemOS SDK Examples Recording
# Records all Python examples that work without Ollama dependency

Output examples/recordings/knowledge_graph_demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20

Type "# Aetheris-MemOS: Knowledge Graph CRUD & Traversal Demo"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "python3 examples/knowledge_graph_demo.py"
Enter
Sleep 8s
